# Service level summary

For priority-1 incidents the response time is two (2) hours from the time the ticket is opened [[cite:obs-3e8d1f061110c633c3e5b6b26c624b8c0789c412 "For priority-1 incidents the response time is two (2) hours from the time the ticket is opened."]]. Priority-1 incidents are escalated to the on-call engineer through the pager rotation [[cite:obs-5db32cbd21d3565ef5244e63bab2ef2cb8bdc55b "Priority-1 incidents are escalated to the on-call engineer through the pager rotation."]].
